# The leakage follows the profile that emits a Gaussian matched to the fibre, up to what the etch can provide.
# Reference: numerical integration on a finer grid in NumPy.
title Gaussian-apodised grating, leakage limited to 0.2 per um
grating angle=10 length=30
leak 0.2
apodise gaussian
expect radiated 0.93147289 1e-06
expect overlap 0.93620066 2e-05
expect efficiency 0.43602277 2e-05
expect position 15.23444980 0.005
expect efficiency_db -3.60491 0.0005
